page.summary:
Three-step workflow tool (Select Topics / Generate and Edit / Export and Save) for producing a weekly
market update bulletin. Tab 1 fetches bullish/bearish topics, upcoming earnings, and macro events;
Tab 2 auto-generates three content sections via GPT-4 (POST /api/general/market-update/generate);
Tab 3 saves a draft to DynamoDB and exports a PowerPoint via S3 presigned URL. Global state managed
via MarketUpdateContext. All API calls route through market-update.ts (marketUpdateApi object).

functions.function:
Path: /api/general/json-tiered/market-overview/summary/all-returns.json (primary);
/api/general/market/market-metrics.json (secondary via getMetricsFromEdge);
portalProxy.getAllMarketData() (tertiary).
Returns AllReturnsResponse with tickers keyed by name.

endpoint.pages_using:
CapitalMarketAssumptions (getCMAAssumptions, getOpalViews — imported directly at CapitalMarketAssumptions.tsx:17);
market.ts fallback path (getAllMarketData, getMarketDataForTicker);
trending.ts (getTrendingTopics, getLatestTrendingTopics)
